    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM302 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM302 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>AE Purchasing and Supply Chain Management</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Robert M. Monczka, Robert B. Handfield, Larry C. Giunipero, James L. Patterson · Cengage Learning · 2020 · 7th · ISBN <code>ISBN-13: 9789814922821</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>All learning materials can be found on the Coursera website.<br>Course 1: Procurement &amp; Sourcing Introduction <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-introduction</a><br>Course 2: Procurement Basics<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-basics</a><br>Course 3: Strategic Sourcing<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/strategic-sourcing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/strategic-sourcing</a><br>Course 4: Supplier Management<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/supplier-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/supplier-management</a><br>Course 5: Supply Market Analysis<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/supply-market-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/supply-market-analysis</a><br>Course 6: Procurement Negotiation<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-negotiation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-negotiation</a><br>Course 7: Strategic Procurement and Sourcing Conclusions<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-conclusions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-conclusions</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Module Global Purchasing, Fiata Higher Diploma in Freight Forwarding<br><br><a href=\"https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296</a></strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>FIATA - VLA - VLI</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>All learning materials can be found on the Coursera website.<br>MOOC 01: IS/IT Governance<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/is-it-governance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/is-it-governance</a><br>MOOC 02: Analysis for Business Systems<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems</a><br>MOOC 03: Enterprise Systems<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/enterprise-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/enterprise-systems</a><br>MOOC 04: IT Infrastructure and Emerging Trends<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/it-infrastructure-and-emerging-trends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/it-infrastructure-and-emerging-trends</a></strong></p><p></p></div>"
